Hanumān sees ruined smoking Laṅkā and fears --- Hanumān blames anger for destroying mission root --- Hanumān dreads Rāma Lakṣmaṇa Sugrīva Bharata ruin --- Hanumān resolves to die by fire or sea --- Hanumān reasons chaste Sītā fire cannot burn --- Hanumān recalls fire spared him through Rāma power --- Cāraṇas proclaim burnt city but unburnt Jānakī --- Hanumān rejoices and revisits Sītā before return
